%% Prospective correction before mapper changes; not a runtime/gameplay diagram.
flowchart TD
    Source[Normalized original Python source] --> AST[Standard Python AST: definition and expression positions]
    AST --> Segment[Extract expression at its original source span]
    Source --> Segment
    Segment --> Calls[Source-authentic callee expressions]
    Segment --> Returns[Compact source-authentic return expressions]
    Calls --> Map[Same maintained map on developer machine and CI]
    Returns --> Map
    Map --> Check[Strict equality and reviewed purpose hashes remain required]
    AST -->|missing source positions| Fail[Fail explicitly; do not guess or accept stale metadata]
    Format[Version-dependent ast.unparse formatting] -. excluded from persisted expression facts .-> Map
